msgid "Source, software evidence and physical qualification"
msgstr "源码、软件证据与物理资格"

msgid ""
"A document describes code; it does not qualify that code merely by being "
"published. A result applies to the exact source, configuration, environment "
"and artifacts that were actually executed. Current document source, "
"described code source and qualified historical code source are separate "
"identities."
msgstr ""
"文档描述代码，发布文档自身不会使代码合格。结果适用于实际执行的精确源码、配置、环境和产物。当前文档源码、所描述代码源码和已合格历史代码源码是独立身份。"

msgid ""
"![Separate Native, ARM, SDK, reproduction and physical "
"evidence](../../assets/diagrams/qualification-evidence.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![独立 Native、ARM、SDK、复现与物理证据](../../assets/diagrams/qualification-"
"evidence.svg)"

msgid "Separate Native, ARM, SDK, reproduction and physical evidence"
msgstr "独立 Native、ARM、SDK、复现与物理证据"

msgid ""
"FIG-11 shows evidence inputs and their independent scope. No arrow turns a "
"model or a workflow into physical measurements."
msgstr "FIG-11 表示证据输入及其独立范围。任何箭头都不会把模型或工作流变成物理测量。"

msgid "Evidence"
msgstr "证据"

msgid "What it can establish"
msgstr "能够建立的结论"

msgid "Limit"
msgstr "限制"

msgid "Native/GoogleTest/GoogleMock"
msgstr "Native/GoogleTest/GoogleMock"

msgid "Executed software contracts against selected models/ports"
msgstr "针对选定模型/端口实际执行的软件合同"

msgid "Not physical timing or electrical truth"
msgstr "不是物理时序或电气事实"

msgid "ARM ELF/BIN/map"
msgstr "ARM ELF/BIN/map"

msgid "Actual compile/link, vector, configuration and resource binding"
msgstr "实际编译/链接、向量表、配置和资源绑定"

msgid "Not MCU execution"
msgstr "不是 MCU 执行"

msgid "Relocated Source SDK consumer"
msgstr "搬移后的 Source SDK 消费者"

msgid "Public include/ABI closure and actual consumer build/run/link"
msgstr "公共包含路径/ABI 闭包与实际消费者构建/运行/链接"

msgid "Not product integration or HIL"
msgstr "不是产品集成或 HIL"

msgid "Two fresh offline builds"
msgstr "两次新生成的离线构建"

msgid "Actual byte comparison in the bound environment"
msgstr "绑定环境内的实际字节比较"

msgid "Not a digest-only or universal reproducibility promise"
msgstr "不是仅有摘要或普遍可复现承诺"

msgid "Software candidate"
msgstr "软件候选"

msgid "Clean exact scope, identities and retained unsigned artifacts"
msgstr "干净精确范围、身份与保留的无签名产物"

msgid "Not signed product release, safety certification or LTS"
msgstr "不是签名产品发布、安全认证或 LTS"

msgid "Real HIL record"
msgstr "真实 HIL 记录"

msgid "Observed hardware/workload/instrument scope on one admitted station"
msgstr "一个已准入的工位上观察的硬件/负载/仪器范围"

msgid "Not unobserved loads or arbitrary boards"
msgstr "不是未观察负载或任意板卡"

msgid "Locate actual records"
msgstr "定位实际记录"

msgid ""
"Current physical MCU records remain `not_executed`: no connected Board "
"station has established clock accuracy, IRQ/DMA timing, Cache behavior, "
"context retention, electrical outputs, Flash power-loss or long-duration "
"performance. Software-reference HIL fixtures cannot be edited into physical "
"qualification."
msgstr ""
"当前 MCU 物理记录保持 `not_executed`：没有已连接 Board 工位建立时钟精度、IRQ/DMA "
"时序、缓存行为、上下文保留、电气输出、Flash 掉电或长期性能。不能编辑软件参考 HIL 夹具来建立物理资格。"

msgid ""
"A new implementation must run its applicable gates with fresh nonempty "
"reports. A new documentation-only build may reference old qualified code "
"while explicitly showing that identity; it must not rewrite the old record "
"or reuse test counts as current execution. See the [performance/HIL "
"guide](../../guides/performance-hil.md) and the [build "
"contract](../../design/build-system.md)."
msgstr ""
"新实现必须执行其适用门禁，提供新生成的非空报告。新的纯文档构建可明确显示身份并引用旧已验证代码，但不得改写旧记录或把旧用例数当成本次执行。见[性能/HIL"
" 指南](../../guides/performance-hil.md)和[构建合同](../../design/build-system.md)。"

msgid "The [delivery index](../../delivery/README.md) retains original results and limitations. The portable I/O results in [PR #62](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/62) bind platform implementation `6b59f666` and the clean Source SDK at `4bf4b5a2`. The SDK completed all 34 maintained consumers after relocation. Its caller-only follow-up does not relabel the four Native runs as executions at a different commit. Subsequent documentation and test-fixture corrections must retain their own applicable checks, merged source and SDK identities in the same PR. The build-system result record binds qualified code `cc6a065c`; its document updates do not inherit those tests to a new HEAD. Earlier SoC extension evidence binds `98270512` independently. Read each linked JSON result and raw receipt for exact full source identity, selected scope, artifact hashes and failed attempts."
msgstr "[交付索引](../../delivery/README.md)保留原始结果和限制。[PR #62](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/62)中的便携 I/O 结果绑定平台实现 `6b59f666` 与 `4bf4b5a2` 的 clean Source SDK；SDK 搬移后完成全部 34 个维护消费者。仅调用者变更的后续提交不会把四种 Native 运行重标为另一提交的执行。后续文档和测试夹具修正必须在同一 PR 保留各自适用的检查、合并源码与 SDK 身份。构建系统结果记录绑定已验证代码 `cc6a065c`，其文档更新不把这些测试转移到新 HEAD；更早的 SoC 扩展证据独立绑定 `98270512`。精确完整源码身份、所选范围、产物哈希和失败尝试以各链接 JSON 结果和原始收据为准。"
